  - text: How do you lead and motivate others?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
  - text: How do you handle work/life balance?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
  - text: Describe your leadership style.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
  - text: How would you handle an underperforming employee?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
  - text: "How do you evaluate your team members\u2019 performance?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 39ea62850134e71418b9a65edc460629, type: 2}
